%%{init: {"theme": "neutral", "flowchart": {"curve": "linear"}}}%%
flowchart LR
    Student([Student])
    UI[React UI]
    AppController[ApplicationsController]
    Workflow[WorkflowService]
    WorkflowRepo[ApplicationTeamRepository]
    RecController[RecommendationsController]
    RecService[RecommendationService]
    RecRepo[RecommendationRepository]
    DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    Provider[OpenAIRecommendationProvider]
    OpenAI[OpenAI Responses API]

    Student -->|1: apply or generate| UI
    UI -->|2a: POST application| AppController
    AppController -->|3a: ApplyAsync| Workflow
    Workflow -->|4a: transactional checks + save| WorkflowRepo
    WorkflowRepo -->|5a: query / insert| DB

    UI -->|2b: POST recommendations| RecController
    RecController -->|3b: RecommendProjectsAsync| RecService
    RecService -->|4b: profile / projects / history| RecRepo
    RecRepo -->|5b: query / insert| DB
    RecService -->|6b: explanation request| Provider
    Provider -->|7b: /v1/responses| OpenAI
    OpenAI -->|8b: structured explanations| Provider
    Provider -->|9b: provider result| RecService
    RecService -->|10b: ranked batch| RecController
    RecController -->|11b: HTTP response| UI
